        "VOCAB|||Sharing Opinions|||Enhance your vocabulary with these essential terms and natural expressions:\n\n*   **In my opinion** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n*   **To be honest** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n*   **From my perspective** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n*   **If you ask me.** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n\n> 🗣️ **Pronunciation Tip:** Keep your vowels clean and practice saying these terms slowly.|||Elo: 'To be honest' is incredibly common in spoken English. Try starting a sentence with it.",
