        "DRILL|||Translation|||Translate: 'Na minha opinião, isso é uma má ideia.'\n\n*   **Instruction:** Translate or complete the prompt out loud.\n*   **Practice Target:** Focus on sentence linking and smooth transitions.\n\n> 🗣️ **Speak Out Loud:** Elo is listening. Try to speak with a clear voice.|||Elo: Don't translate word-for-word. Use 'In my opinion...'|||In my opinion, that is a bad idea",
