        "INTRO|||The Present Simple|||This is the foundation of English. We use it for facts, habits, and routines.|||Elo: Let's master the foundation.",
        "CONCEPT|||The 'S' Rule|||I work, You work, We work, They work. BUT: He works, She works, It works. Add 's' for the 3rd person singular.\n\n*   **Key Concept Explanation:** Understanding this rule allows you to sound natural and confident when speaking.\n*   **How it works:** Apply this structure directly in daily conversations.\n\n> 💡 **Tutor Pro-Tip:** Don't translate directly from Portuguese! Focus on the English chunk structure.|||Elo: This is a common error. Remember the 's'.",
